OL,3,AEU chief opens door for Canada to
OL,4,Abecome 'associate member'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWithout mentioning the US president by
OL,7,Fname, von der Leyen said offering
OL,8,FCanada some sort of EU membership was
OL,9,F"not a partnership against anyone else,
OL,10,Fbut for our common strength."
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
